    "result_text": "The full suite is just the one acceptance test, and it passes. **BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\nThe implementation is complete. In `ClinicServiceImpl.generateCustomerCode`, the computed `'<REGION>-<HASH8>'` code now passes through a new `deduplicateCustomerCode` helper that:\n\n- Collects the `customerCode`s of all other owners (excluding the owner being saved, so re-saving isn't a self-collision).\n- Returns the base code unchanged when it's free.\n- Otherwise appends `'-<n>'` with the smallest `n \u2265 2` that isn't already taken, returning the de-duplicated code.\n\nI added the `java.util.HashSet` import (`Set` was already present). The test suite is green.",
